# VapeDesk changes

The original single JavaScript file is separated into role-specific files plus one shared file.


customer.js  customer shop, cart checkout, and order tracking

admin.js`  admin dashboard and restricted page message

cashier.js point of sale, receipts, and online order processing

custodian.js  inventory, stock updates, product creation or deletion, and price editing.

shared.js shared database & localStorage helpers, mock API, app state, authentication, shared product picker & cart helpers, navigation & rendering, and initialize

